# Prototype reference app (public/prototype) — generated test artefacts only.
# The prototype source itself is tracked; these are regenerable outputs.
# /shots and /_fixtures are at the root because the npm test scripts run from the project root,
# so Playwright writes its screenshots relative to there rather than to the prototype folder.
/shots
/_fixtures
/public/prototype/shots
/public/prototype/_fixtures
/public/prototype/_test_output.txt
